Prompt.md
PRD.md

# Ignore SQLite database & WAL runtime files
storage/*.sqlite
storage/*.sqlite-wal
storage/*.sqlite-shm

# Keep storage directory tracked
!storage/.gitkeep
!storage/.htaccess

